    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "右半平面包含零点的系统，在输入频率由零至无穷大的范围内所产生的净相角变化量，大于所有极点和零点均位于左半平面时的净相角变化量；相角在零点转折频率处减小，而非表现为左半平面零点通常引起的相角增加。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "A system with a zero in the RHP undergoes a net change in phase for frequency inputs between zero and infinity that is greater than if all poles and zeros were in the LHP; the phase decreases at the zero break point instead of exhibiting the usual phase increase for an LHP zero.",
